   "unit": "FLAG",
   "caption": "One world",
   "fact": "NOWHERE ELSE TO GO",
   "lines": [
    {
     "t": 59.855,
     "d": 5.227,
     "text": "And if that one government ever went wrong, there would be no other country to escape to."
